{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_sidero_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_sidero_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "勤勉之人",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sidero_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0784b19323d463254484abf519eeb814765a411265d97896f6192acd318f72c4",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 铸铁"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "喂，喂，听得见吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好久不见，会长小姐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "听说您来访了，就冒昧向您发起通讯，希望没打扰到您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是，是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "父母那边的生意多亏有您照顾，没有亏损。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您知道的，科林尼亚人就看重这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "托您的福，我在这里过得很好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您看什么时候能见个面吃顿饭呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "后天吗，好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我随时都有时间！好不容易能和会长小姐吃顿饭，高兴还来不及呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好的，好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "普通一点吗，那就食堂吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "食堂的菜不合您胃口吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "包厢？会不会太昂贵了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是我欠考虑了，抱歉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好，好的，我会准时到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "谢谢您，会长小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "再见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "认识了会长小姐那么久，她还真是一点变化都没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我倒是杂七杂八的东西学了一堆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那边，发生什么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "坚雷小姐？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "放开我，放——开——我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你不动我就放开你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您不是应该和杜宾小姐出任务了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这个嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "因为一些个人原因......没能去成，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那能请您帮助我训练一下吗，最近——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "抱歉啊，我还有事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "放开放开放开放开！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "有事的话，请带上我吧，我一定能帮上您的。在那之后——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "是非常私人的事！嗯，很私人，就不麻烦你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "哇————！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "泡泡，你还想在博士那本子上多一笔吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "有什么我能帮忙的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你说她吗——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "丰蹄姐姐，教官欺负我唔唔唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "她训练的时候跑着跑着人就跑出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "训练？有训练吗？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "是玩游戏，对，玩游戏的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你应该知道，泡泡一来劲就喜欢乱跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "刚刚要是没拉住她，旁边这堵隔墙马上就消失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "唔唔唔唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "对了铸铁小姐，我这有个请求，不知道你能不能听听呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你看，泡泡这么精神，正巧需要发散一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "而铸铁小姐也需要陪练吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "话是没错......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "如果是力量训练的话，泡泡绝对是最佳的对手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "单纯比力量，教官团都不是她的对手啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "就是就是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "恰好铸铁小姐身手不错，和泡泡练练吧，可以的话也教她一点技巧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "我才不要教。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那就麻烦坚雷小姐安排训练室了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "第六训练室，已经打过招呼了，直接用就行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那么，泡泡今天就交给你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "尽情地训练去吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "你好泡泡，我们一起去锻炼吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "哇嗷——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "别跑，训练室在那边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "祝你们训练愉快啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "呼，一口气处理了两个大麻烦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "铸铁对泡泡，效果到底怎么样呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三刻钟后\n第六训练室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "丰蹄姐姐你怎么这么能跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "你也不错啊，体力很充沛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "哼哼，萨尔贡哪里我没有跑过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是这样吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "泡泡可是超强的，怎么会跑几步就不行了呢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那可太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我们来近身对抗吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "那是啥，听上去就不好玩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "拿出所有的力量撞过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "丰蹄姐姐你会飞出去的哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "试试看，我应该挡得住。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "我来——喽——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "咚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "喝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "不愧是，塞拉托。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "呵呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "等等，停停停！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "怎么了，受伤了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "这次不算！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "我刚刚没有使出全力！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那再来一次。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "这里应该差不多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "再远一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "再——远一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "丰蹄姐姐一会被撞到不要哭鼻子哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "那我要进攻了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "哈啊——哇啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "轰！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "哈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "唔呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "论力量泡泡是不会输的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是这样——吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "喝啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "不可能！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "泡泡不会输的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "嘿呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "嘿——啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "咚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "啊，哈......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "教官说的没错，力量对抗上，泡泡的确是个可敬的对手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "输掉了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "丰蹄姐姐你怎么力气那么大！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "因为经常锻炼啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "身体多活动，总能看到成果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "姐姐你说谎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "我也一直跑来跑去，力气怎么就没有变大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "可能是方法不对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "姐姐有没有小刻的火神大姐强？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "火神......应该没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "在米诺斯，没人会愿意和铁匠为敌。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "但姐姐也很强了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我还需要磨练，还要变得更强。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "我也要变得更强，把小刻打翻在地！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "刻俄柏，吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "小刻力气不大，但就是很能打。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "总有一天，我要把她打翻在地，哇嗷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "呵呵，好像还挺有意思的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "所以我要特训，特训！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "再来丰蹄姐姐，我就不信打不过你！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好！既然你这么有精神，我也要和你一起，坚持到最后。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "特训！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "特训！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "两小时后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "丰蹄姐姐，我，我没有力气了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "你在说什么呢，越是这种时候，越能锻炼自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "现在才是展现意志的时候！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "再来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "还要，还要再来吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "伟大的战士可不会在训练场里倒下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "那，我来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "嘿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啪嗒"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "真的，动不了了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "真是遗憾，看来你在耐力上还需要更多的锻炼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "好累，我要回宿舍睡觉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "不可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "唉......为什么......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "坚雷小姐让我看管你一整天，我有这个责任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "现在就睡觉的话，刚刚的练习就全白费了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "现在的你应该会需要些康复性运动，缓解一下酸痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "还要动啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "唉——不要——我不干了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "呜哇啊啊啊啊啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "有时间哭，不如来多对抗一下吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "呜呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "我要回家睡觉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "哦——这不是还有力气吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "别再跑了，请回来把力气用在正确的地方！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "监控摄像头",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "跟丢了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "从体力和耐力上来说，我应该是有优势的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "为什么总是会跟丢呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "看来三十节相关课程还是不够，要找教官们再着重训练一下追踪这方面的技术。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "铃兰小姐，您好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "您，您好，铸铁姐姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（就靠你，和你的大尾巴了，铃兰！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（一定要把我遮住啊！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "（不要再抖了泡泡，会露馅的！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您刚刚有见到过泡泡吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "没，没有呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "奇怪，这里是墙角，怎么会突然消失呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "也许是，爬通风管道走掉了吧，哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "从体型上来说，的确有可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（为什么铃兰有一根尾巴一直在晃？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（爸爸说有些人说谎的时候尾巴就会甩来甩去，原来是真的啊！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（铃兰你真好！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（但是可不可以不要在我鼻子前面晃，好痒哦。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（糟糕！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（啊，啊——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啊嚏"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "呀啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "（不要抓尾巴啊！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "抱歉铸铁姐姐，我有点感冒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "啊嚏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "感冒可是大问题，看医生了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "还，还没有，麻烦别人可不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "我准备再休息一会，然后自己过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那可不行，我现在就带你去见医生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "没事的，铸铁姐姐，只是小毛病，真的只是小毛病，我自己可以的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "（拿出手绢擦了擦鼻子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "你，是想省钱吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "唉，唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "没有的事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "果然是这样啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（是什么啊，她看到我了吗！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "（她是不是误解了什么啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我理解你的心情，我老家那里想给自己省一点小钱不去看医生结果病死的人实在是太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "你那么小，不应该受这种罪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "要是付不起，我来帮你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（她在说什么？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "真的，没有事情，而且罗德岛对干员的初步问诊是免费的......咿呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（呀，完了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "（看不见我看不见我看不见我。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "不用说了，我都明白的，现在就送你去医疗部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "唉，唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "您真的搞错了铸铁姐姐！爸爸妈妈每个月都会给我寄生活费的，还会给我写信寄照片——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铃兰",
      "text": "您听，听我说呀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "呼，呼呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "差一点就被发现了，多亏了铃兰的大尾巴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡泡",
      "text": "你受苦了铃兰，我会报答你的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夜晚\n训练中心入口"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "所以泡泡最后，消失了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "把铃兰小姐送到医务室去以后怎么找都没找到她，只好来找您了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "都是我的错，是我没有看住她，抱歉，坚雷教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "请您惩罚我吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "不，不至于......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "泡泡的话，现在应该在宿舍里休息吧，我和宿管确认过了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "宿管说难得看到这样乖巧的泡泡，这里也有你一份功劳，辛苦辛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "谢谢你今天的付出，要是没事的话，你也赶紧回去休息吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "教官，其实我还有一点疑惑的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯，请说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您觉得我的侦查和追踪课程上得如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你很优秀，非常优秀，有什么问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我觉得自己这一方面特别欠缺，在追踪其他人的时候总是失手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我是不是，做得还不够好？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那些只是，例外。对，例外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "毕竟现实生活环境和战场还是有区别的，我想你在战场上的追踪能力绝——对没有问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是这样啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "是这样，没错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "既然教官这样说，我就安心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那我可不可以申请现实生活环境下的侦查追踪课程呢，我想，对这一方面的学习也是很重要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯——嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "啊，关，关于这一点嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "今天时间不早了，你就回去休息吧。我这两天和教官团的其他同事们商量一下，想必能给你一个满意的答复。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "好的教官，谢谢教官，那我就先回去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯，一路走好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "关于这件事，你怎么看，杜宾教官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "她好像已经发现一点征兆了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "我们这边的案例拼凑一下应该还能应付。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "下一次可就没有那么好运了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "相信在下一次之前我们能够找到解决方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "只要不让她学到最具破坏性的追踪手法，其他都很好安排。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "她要学到了，别说博士，我们也逃不掉了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "至于泡泡那块，有什么成效吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我看过摄像头记录了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你真应该自己去看看监控。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "宿管说，泡泡回去除了洗澡一直窝在宿舍里，连饭都是请室友带的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这一段时间内想必她听到“铸铁”这两个字就要打寒颤吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "教官您是在叫我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷/杜宾",
      "text": "？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你怎么回来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "杜宾教官您也在啊，外勤任务这么快就结束了吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "嗯......只是到主舰周边物色合适的场地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "那可太好了，其实我是想询问一下，课程可不可以从明天就开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "关于这件事——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我和杜宾教官先商量一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "（小声）你办法多，先想办法搪塞过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "（小声）坚雷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）其实，我和一个深入了解铸铁的人谈了一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）她虽然很惊讶铸铁现在的状态，但给了我一些建设性的建议。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）一会听我的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "（小声）好，拜托了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "铸铁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "其实是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我呢，刚刚和杜宾教官简单商量了一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "觉得训练可能不能满足你的要求了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "（小声）喂，你知不知道自己在说什么？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）就这一次，信我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您的意思......是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我知道你有时会担任博士的护卫，博士也时常会从你身边溜走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "这是我护卫失职，抱歉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "所以我才更需——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "所以你才更需要从其他方面为博士分忧解难，我说的对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "您是说？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你不觉得，博士最近身体不太好吗？睡眠不是很充足，饮食也不规律，好像还有些轻——微的慢性病症。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "与其继续精进战斗方面的技巧，让博士健康起来，难道不是一种更好的选择吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你可以好好思考一下我的建议，晚安，铸铁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "晚安......教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "（小声）你们哥伦比亚人肚子里都有那么多坏水吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）只是些小聪明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）别愣着了，快走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "（小声）那，真的有效果吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）至少她在思考这件事了，先走吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "（小声）万一她又提训练我们就没好觉睡了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "教官说得对。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我以为博士只需要一个，护卫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "不，是我理解错了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我以为护卫只需要保证雇主的人身安全就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我能做到更多的，可我却连想都没想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "会长小姐原来是这个意思吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我虽然对吃没什么要求，但吃得好一些的确会让生活质量提高许多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "会长小姐好不容易来罗德岛一趟，我却只想着请她吃食堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "真不应该。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "博士，也是这样想的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "只是不好意思和愚钝的我说而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我决定了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "铸铁",
      "text": "我要拯救博士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
